  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The North American Plant Protection Organization (NAPPO)-International Standard for Phytosanitary Measures (ISPM) 38-International Movement of Seeds Workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">APHIS is participating in the North American Plant Protection Organization (NAPPO) workshop on International Standard on Phytosanitary Measures (ISPM) 38: International movement of seed for Costa Rica. The workshop focuses on strategies to better facilitate the safe international movement of seeds and training to implement ISPM 38: International movement of seed. The workshop increases collaboration amoungst participants and improves implementation of ISPM 38.</narrative>
  </description>
